.SH "1\&.20\&.0"
.PP
.SS "Minor Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Stabilize \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnNavigation\fP (\fR#11973\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Add new \fRPatchRoutesOnNavigationFunctionArgs\fP type for convenience (\fR#11967\fP)
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Stabilize \fRunstable_dataStrategy\fP (\fR#11974\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Stabilize the \fRunstable_flushSync\fP option for navigations and fetchers (\fR#11989\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Stabilize the \fRunstable_viewTransition\fP option for navigations and the corresponding \fRunstable_useViewTransitionState\fP hook (\fR#11989\fP)
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix bug when submitting to the current contextual route (parent route with an index child) when an \fR?index\fP param already exists from a prior submission (\fR#12003\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix \fRuseFormAction\fP bug - when removing \fR?index\fP param it would not keep other non-Remix \fRindex\fP params (\fR#12003\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix bug with fetchers not persisting \fRpreventScrollReset\fP through redirects during concurrent fetches (\fR#11999\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Remove internal cache to fix issues with interrupted \fRpatchRoutesOnNavigation\fP calls (\fR#12055\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
We used to cache in-progress calls to \fRpatchRoutesOnNavigation\fP internally so that multiple navigations with the same start/end would only execute the function once and use the same promise
.IP "  \(bu" 4
However, this approach was at odds with \fRpatch\fP short circuiting if a navigation was interrupted (and the \fRrequest\&.signal\fP aborted) since the first invocation's \fRpatch\fP would no-op
.IP "  \(bu" 4
This cache also made some assumptions as to what a valid cache key might be - and is oblivious to any other application-state changes that may have occurred
.IP "  \(bu" 4
So, the cache has been removed because in \fImost\fP cases, repeated calls to something like \fRimport()\fP for async routes will already be cached automatically - and if not it's easy enough for users to implement this cache in userland
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Avoid unnecessary \fRconsole\&.error\fP on fetcher abort due to back-to-back revalidation calls (\fR#12050\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Expose errors thrown from \fRpatchRoutesOnNavigation\fP directly to \fRuseRouteError\fP instead of wrapping them in a 400 \fRErrorResponse\fP instance (\fR#12111\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix types for \fRRouteObject\fP within \fRPatchRoutesOnNavigationFunction\fP's \fRpatch\fP method so it doesn't expect agnostic route objects passed to \fRpatch\fP (\fR#11967\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix bugs with \fRpartialHydration\fP when hydrating with errors (\fR#12070\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Remove internal \fRdiscoveredRoutes\fP FIFO queue from \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnNavigation\fP (\fR#11977\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.19\&.2"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Update the \fRunstable_dataStrategy\fP API to allow for more advanced implementations (\fR#11943\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Rename \fRunstable_HandlerResult\fP to \fRunstable_DataStrategyResult\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
The return signature has changed from a parallel array of \fRunstable_DataStrategyResult[]\fP (parallel to \fRmatches\fP) to a key/value object of \fRrouteId => unstable_DataStrategyResult\fP
.IP "    \(bu" 6
This allows you to more easily decide to opt-into or out-of revalidating data that may not have been revalidated by default (via \fRmatch\&.shouldLoad\fP)
.IP "    \(bu" 6
⚠️ This is a breaking change if you've currently adopted \fRunstable_dataStrategy\fP
.PP

.IP "  \(bu" 4
Added a new \fRfetcherKey\fP parameter to \fRunstable_dataStrategy\fP to allow differentiation from navigational and fetcher calls
.IP "  \(bu" 4
You should now return/throw a result from your \fRhandlerOverride\fP instead of returning a \fRDataStrategyResult\fP
.IP "    \(bu" 6
If you are aggregating the results of \fRmatch\&.resolve()\fP into a final results object you should not need to think about the \fRDataStrategyResult\fP type
.IP "    \(bu" 6
If you are manually filling your results object from within your \fRhandlerOverride\fP, then you will need to assign a \fRDataStrategyResult\fP as the value so React Router knows if it's a successful execution or an error\&.
.PP

.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Preserve view transition through redirects (\fR#11925\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix blocker usage when \fRblocker\&.proceed\fP is called quickly/synchronously (\fR#11930\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Preserve pending view transitions through a router revalidation call (\fR#11917\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.19\&.1"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fog of War: Update \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnMiss\fP logic so that we call the method when we match routes with dynamic param or splat segments in case there exists a higher-scoring static route that we've not yet discovered\&. (\fR#11883\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
We also now leverage an internal FIFO queue of previous paths we've already called \fRunstable_patchRouteOnMiss\fP against so that we don't re-call on subsequent navigations to the same path
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Rename \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnMiss\fP to \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnNavigation\fP to match new behavior (\fR#11888\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.19\&.0"
.PP
.SS "Minor Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add a new \fRreplace(url, init?)\fP alternative to \fRredirect(url, init?)\fP that performs a \fRhistory\&.replaceState\fP instead of a \fRhistory\&.pushState\fP on client-side navigation redirects (\fR#11811\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add a new \fRunstable_data()\fP API for usage with Remix Single Fetch (\fR#11836\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
This API is not intended for direct usage in React Router SPA applications
.IP "  \(bu" 4
It is primarily intended for usage with \fRcreateStaticHandler\&.query()\fP to allow loaders/actions to return arbitrary data + \fRstatus\fP/\fRheaders\fP without forcing the serialization of data into a \fRResponse\fP instance
.IP "  \(bu" 4
This allows for more advanced serialization tactics via \fRunstable_dataStrategy\fP such as serializing via \fRturbo-stream\fP in Remix Single Fetch
.IP "  \(bu" 4
⚠️ This removes the \fRstatus\fP field from \fRHandlerResult\fP
.IP "    \(bu" 6
If you need to return a specific \fRstatus\fP from \fRunstable_dataStrategy\fP you should instead do so via \fRunstable_data()\fP
.PP

.PP

.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix internal cleanup of interrupted fetchers to avoid invalid revalidations on navigations (\fR#11839\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
When a \fRfetcher\&.load\fP is interrupted by an \fRaction\fP submission, we track it internally and force revalidation once the \fRaction\fP completes
.IP "  \(bu" 4
We previously only cleared out this internal tracking info on a successful \fInavigation\fP submission
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Therefore, if the \fRfetcher\&.load\fP was interrupted by a \fRfetcher\&.submit\fP, then we wouldn't remove it from this internal tracking info on successful load (incorrectly)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
And then on the next navigation it's presence in the internal tracking would automatically trigger execution of the \fRfetcher\&.load\fP again, ignoring any \fRshouldRevalidate\fP logic
.IP "  \(bu" 4
This fix cleans up the internal tracking so it applies to both navigation submission and fetcher submissions
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix initial hydration behavior when using \fRfuture\&.v7_partialHydration\fP along with \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnMiss\fP (\fR#11838\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
During initial hydration, \fRrouter\&.state\&.matches\fP will now include any partial matches so that we can render ancestor \fRHydrateFallback\fP components
.PP

.PP
.SH "1\&.18\&.0"
.PP
.SS "Minor Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Stabilize \fRfuture\&.unstable_skipActionErrorRevalidation\fP as \fRfuture\&.v7_skipActionErrorRevalidation\fP (\fR#11769\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
When this flag is enabled, actions will not automatically trigger a revalidation if they return/throw a \fRResponse\fP with a \fR4xx\fP/\fR5xx\fP status code
.IP "  \(bu" 4
You may still opt-into revalidation via \fRshouldRevalidate\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
This also changes \fRshouldRevalidate\fP's \fRunstable_actionStatus\fP parameter to \fRactionStatus\fP
