Fix bubbling of errors thrown from \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnMiss\fP (\fR#11786\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix hydration in SSR apps using \fRunstable_patchRoutesOnMiss\fP that matched a splat route on the server (\fR#11790\fP)
.PP
