Fog of War (unstable): Trigger a new \fRrouter\&.routes\fP identity/reflow during route patching (\fR#11740\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fog of War (unstable): Fix initial matching when a splat route matches (\fR#11759\fP)
