.SH "1\&.1\&.0"
.PP
This release introduces support for \fROptional Route Segments\fP\&. Now, adding a \fR?\fP to the end of any path segment will make that entire segment optional\&. This works for both static segments and dynamic parameters\&.

.PP
\fBOptional Params Examples\fP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Path \fRlang?/about\fP will match:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fR/:lang/about\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fR/about\fP
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Path \fR/multistep/:widget1?/widget2?/widget3?\fP will match:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fR/multistep\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fR/multistep/:widget1\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fR/multistep/:widget1/:widget2\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fR/multistep/:widget1/:widget2/:widget3\fP
.PP

