.PP
.SS "Minor Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Allows optional routes and optional static segments (\fR#9650\fP)
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Stop incorrectly matching on partial named parameters, i\&.e\&. \fR<Route path="prefix-:param">\fP, to align with how splat parameters work\&. If you were previously relying on this behavior then it's recommended to extract the static portion of the path at the \fRuseParams\fP call site: (\fR#9506\fP)
.PP

.PP
.PP
.nf
// Old behavior at URL /prefix\-123
<Route path="prefix\-:id" element={<Comp /> }>

function Comp() {
  let params = useParams(); // { id: '123' }
  let id = params\&.id; // "123"
  \&.\&.\&.
}

// New behavior at URL /prefix\-123
<Route path=":id" element={<Comp /> }>

function Comp() {
  let params = useParams(); // { id: 'prefix\-123' }
  let id = params\&.id\&.replace(/^prefix\-/, ''); // "123"
  \&.\&.\&.
}
.fi
.PP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Persist \fRheaders\fP on \fRloader\fP \fRrequest\fP's after SSR document \fRaction\fP request (\fR#9721\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix requests sent to revalidating loaders so they reflect a GET request (\fR#9660\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix issue with deeply nested optional segments (\fR#9727\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
GET forms now expose a submission on the loading navigation (\fR#9695\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix error boundary tracking for multiple errors bubbling to the same boundary (\fR#9702\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.0\&.5"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix requests sent to revalidating loaders so they reflect a \fRGET\fP request (\fR#9680\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Remove \fRinstanceof Response\fP checks in favor of \fRisResponse\fP (\fR#9690\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix \fRURL\fP creation in Cloudflare Pages or other non-browser-environments (\fR#9682\fP, \fR#9689\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add \fRrequestContext\fP support to static handler \fRquery\fP/\fRqueryRoute\fP (\fR#9696\fP)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Note that the unstable API of \fRqueryRoute(path, routeId)\fP has been changed to \fRqueryRoute(path, { routeId, requestContext })\fP
.PP

.PP
.SH "1\&.0\&.4"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Throw an error if an \fRaction\fP/\fRloader\fP function returns \fRundefined\fP as revalidations need to know whether the loader has previously been executed\&. \fRundefined\fP also causes issues during SSR stringification for hydration\&. You should always ensure you \fRloader\fP/\fRaction\fP returns a value, and you may return \fRnull\fP if you don't wish to return anything\&. (\fR#9511\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Properly handle redirects to external domains (\fR#9590\fP, \fR#9654\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Preserve the HTTP method on 307/308 redirects (\fR#9597\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Support \fRbasename\fP in static data routers (\fR#9591\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Enhanced \fRErrorResponse\fP bodies to contain more descriptive text in internal 403/404/405 scenarios
.PP
.SH "1\&.0\&.3"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix hrefs generated when using \fRcreateHashRouter\fP (\fR#9409\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
fix encoding/matching issues with special chars (\fR#9477\fP, \fR#9496\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Support \fRbasename\fP and relative routing in \fRloader\fP/\fRaction\fP redirects (\fR#9447\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Ignore pathless layout routes when looking for proper submission \fRaction\fP function (\fR#9455\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
properly support \fRindex\fP routes with a \fRpath\fP in \fRuseResolvedPath\fP (\fR#9486\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add UMD build for \fR@remix-run/router\fP (\fR#9446\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
fix \fRcreateURL\fP in local file execution in Firefox (\fR#9464\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Updates to \fRunstable_createStaticHandler\fP for incorporating into Remix (\fR#9482\fP, \fR#9465\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.0\&.2"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Reset \fRactionData\fP after a successful action redirect (\fR#9334\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Update \fRmatchPath\fP to avoid false positives on dash-separated segments (\fR#9300\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
If an index route has children, it will result in a runtime error\&. We have strengthened our \fRRouteObject\fP/\fRRouteProps\fP types to surface the error in TypeScript\&. (\fR#9366\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.0\&.1"
.PP
.SS "Patch Changes"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Preserve state from \fRinitialEntries\fP (\fR#9288\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Preserve \fR?index\fP for fetcher get submissions to index routes (\fR#9312\fP)
.PP
.SH "1\&.0\&.0"
.PP
This is the first stable release of \fR@remix-run/router\fP, which provides all the underlying routing and data loading/mutation logic for \fRreact-router\fP\&. You should \fInot\fP be using this package directly unless you are authoring a routing library similar to \fRreact-router\fP\&.

.PP
For an overview of the features provided by \fRreact-router\fP, we recommend you go check out the \fRdocs\fP, especially the \fRfeature overview\fP and the \fRtutorial\fP\&.

.PP
